"releaseNotes":"An even more personalized SNKRS experience is here. Introducing a new set of home screen icons to make SNKRS truly yours. Select from different options inspired by the sneakers that you love.\n\nSNKRS Maps is expanding to include more partner shops, community events, and select Nike stores.", "price":0.00, "artistId":301521406, "artistName":"Nike, Inc", "bundleId":"com.nike.onenikecommerce", "trackId":911130812, "trackName":"Nike SNKRS: Sneakers & Apparel", "releaseDate":"2015-02-12T08:06:30Z", "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true, "primaryGenreName":"Shopping", "primaryGenreId":6024, "sellerName":"Nike, Inc", "currentVersionReleaseDate":"2026-10-23T09:39:54Z", "version":"8.8.1", "wrapperType":"software", "currency":"USD", 
"description":"Explore, buy, and unlock the best of Nike, Jordan, and Converse. SNKRS is more than a shoes shopping app - giving sneakerheads insider access to the latest launches featuring exclusive sneakers and streetwear apparel. \n\nSNKRS FEATURES\n\nSTAY A STEP AHEAD\n* Shop sneakers and streetwear: Buy the latest sneaker styles and trending women’s and men’s clothing\n* Set Notifications: Stay updated with the latest sneaker news, releases, and exclusive stories. View upcoming drops and prepare for the streetwear you want most – from the latest shoes to trending apparel.\n* Reserve Sneakers with SNKRS Pass: Secure your pair with SNKRS and pick it up at your nearest shoe store for a seamless launch day experience\n* Get Exclusive Access: Get rewarded with invite-only launches to some of the most coveted women’s and men’s clothing and sneaker styles.\n* Catch Surprise Drops: Be ready for a range of unique launch scavenger hunts – access might be hidden in geo-located events, scannable augmented reality targets or scratch-able images\n\nEXPLORE THE COMMUNITY\n* View Exclusive SNKRS Stories: Learn about the inspiration and heritage behind your favorite streetwear styles and sneakers. Access untold tales from the SNKRS community\n* Vote on Polls: Have your voice heard in the sneaker community by answering questions that inform everything from future products to experiences and content\n* Watch SNKRS Live: Tune in for the latest sneaker news on exclusive collabs and upcoming releases. Catch SNKRS livestreams and join the conversation with live polling, never heard stories, the inside scoop, and more\n* Discover SNKRS Maps: Whether you’re traveling to a new city or exploring your local neighborhood, SNKRS Maps is with you. Visit local sneaker stores, community spaces and events near you.\n\nHOW TO GET STARTED\n* Sign up or log in with your Nike account\n* Save your correct name, size, and shipping address under your profile so you are ready for\nlaunch day\n* Start shopping and discover fresh streetwear apparel and sneakers\n\nJoin the community today.", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.857549999999999812416717759333550930023193359375, "sellerUrl":"http://nike.com/snkrs", "languageCodesISO2A":["CA", "CS", "DA", "NL", "EN", "FR", "DE", "EL", "HU", "IT", "JA", "KO", "PL", "PT", "ZH", "ES", "SV"], "fileSizeBytes":"288058368", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":1413379, "trackContentRating":"4+", "trackCensoredName":"Nike SNKRS: Sneakers & Apparel", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/nike-snkrs-sneakers-apparel/id911130812?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "averageUserRating":4.857549999999999812416717759333550930023193359375, "minimumOsVersion":"18.0", "genreIds":["6024", "6012"], "genres":["Shopping", "Lifestyle"], "userRatingCount":1413379}, 
