"description":"YOUR ADIDAS - MORE THAN A SHOPPING EXPERIENCE. adidas puts you closer to the action with instant access to fashion releases, products, sports apparel, and sneakers. Discover exclusive online deals on clothes, shoes, and gear. Shop online, get athlete inspiration, stories, and app exclusives – all available on adidas.\n\nRunning, training, basketball, baseball, soccer or golf? The adidas app has what you need and more. Whether you’re putting time in on the court, the gym, the golf course, or the track, adidas brings you the shoes and apparel to elevate your sport and your style. adidas brings you exclusive savings and deals on sneakers, sportswear, sports gear, and men's and women’s clothing.\n\nOnline shopping for streetwear? The adidas app allows you to easily build your own 3-Stripes style. Sneakers and Original clothes that draw from adidas archives to shape the looks of today. Online shopping for fitness fashion lines for men, women’s clothing, and kids’ apparel, adidas always keeps it fresh.\n\nadiClub allows you to unlock the best of adidas shopping -  women’s clothing, men’s apparel, sportswear, and sneakers. Become a member, earn points with each purchase, and use them towards the next sneaker release, sports clothes, or fashion fit. Level up and unlock even more exclusive rewards by completing your profile, shopping, and leaving reviews. With free shipping and returns, adidas is always bringing you the best of adiClub benefits, all the time.\n\nBe the first to discover exclusive Originals, sportswear collections, streetwear, and sneakers. Download today and discover online shopping that’s all in or nothing with our apparel and shoe store.\n\nADIDAS FEATURES FOR ONLINE SHOPPING\n\nSHOE SHOPPING FOR EXCLUSIVE SNEAKERS\n- Dive into collections that are perfect for any sport or style\n- adidas offers exclusive collaborations in clothing and sneakers, and provides seamless online shopping\n- Sneaker styles from adidas classic Originals like the iconic Samba\n\nSPORTSWEAR FOR EVERY ATHLETE\n- Men’s clothing, women’s apparel, and gear that’s perfect for your next workout or training session\n- Basketball, soccer, baseball, and more. adidas has the clothing you need to perform in style\n- Predator to Ultraboost, there’s something for every athlete and activity\n\nADIDAS ORIGINALS & EXCLUSIVES\n- Shop legendary clothing from adidas with timeless pieces and styles\n- Sneakers and apparel ranging from comfy lifestyle to fashionable streetwear for men’s and women’s clothing\n- Enhance your 3-Stripe style with new releases and upcoming launches\n- Sneaker collections from Samba, Gazelle, and more icons find the best of yesterday and tomorrow on adidas\n\nALL IN, ALL THE BENEFITS\n- Online shopping is seamless with adidas. Secure your next pair of sneakers or apparel with exclusive adiClub member benefits\n- Gain exclusive access to shop and vote on members-only products, clothing, and sneakers\n- Unlock discounts, limited edition drops, and invitations to special events\n- Access free premium training apps, exclusive offers, and more great rewards\n- Be the first to access deals on shoes and women’s and men’s clothing\n\nCONVENIENT ONLINE SHOPPING\n- Get alerts when your favorite adidas sneakers and clothes go on sale\n- Order and buy in just a few taps with seamless online shopping\n- Get free standard shipping with adiClub\n- Track your orders and purchase history for easy returns on gear, clothing, sneakers, and more\n- Gain access to special offers, rewards, gifts, and gear from our apparel and shoe store\n\nJoin adidas today and discover the latest in sportswear, streetwear, and fashion all in one.\n\nWith adidas, “You Got This.” Download today.", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.8885600000000000164845914696343243122100830078125, "sellerUrl":"https://www.adidas.com/us/adidasapp", "languageCodesISO2A":["AR", "CS", "DA", "NL", "EN", "FI", "FR", "DE", "EL", "HE", "ID", "IT", "JA", "KO", "NN", "PL", "PT", "RU", "SK", "ES", "SV", "TH", "ZH", "TR", "VI"], "fileSizeBytes":"295192576", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":829155, "trackContentRating":"4+", "trackCensoredName":"adidas: Shop Shoes & Clothing", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/adidas-shop-shoes-clothing/id1266591536?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "averageUserRating":4.8885600000000000164845914696343243122100830078125, "minimumOsVersion":"18.0", "genreIds":["6024", "6004"], "genres":["Shopping", "Sports"], "userRatingCount":829155}]
